      "value": "I imagine at some point the older content will most likely become incompatible with new versions of unity anyway due to all the changes. Right now the update to unity 2018 was able to keep compatibility but vrchat would not be using all of the new features because they are not stable for vr use yet in this LTS branch, whereas unity 2019 and 2020 have improvements and full releases for the experimental features added during unity 2018.",
